@baseUrl = http://localhost:5128
@HostAddress = {{baseUrl}}
@companyAdminEmail = admin@al-salamah.com
@companyAdminPassword = User@123456
@missingJob = 3f9a1c22-7b44-4e18-9d05-6c2e8a5f1b70

### =====================================================================
### 16. ZATCA TAX INVOICING (FR-ZAT, analysis/07 §4.1)
### =====================================================================
### A tax invoice bills the quotation the client accepted — every figure comes from it, and the
### seller's identity from the company profile. Issuing allocates an INV-{YYYY}-{00000} number,
### links the invoice into the company's SHA-256 chain, and builds the five-tag TLV QR payload,
### all in one transaction. An issued invoice can be voided but never edited or deleted; a voided
### one stays in the chain and a corrected invoice may then be raised.
###
### The lifecycle — issue on a sealed project, double-billing refusal, cancel-and-reissue, a real
### two-request race, out-of-band tampering caught by chain verification — is covered by
### ZatcaInvoicingTests (xUnit) and by a scripted live run against SQL Server. This suite is a
### smoke test of the surface with explicit assertions. Field casing is camelCase (D-8).
###
### NOT covered here: submission to ZATCA (clearance / reporting). That needs UBL 2.1 XML and an
### ECDSA stamp from a ZATCA-issued certificate, which require onboarding the company with ZATCA.

### 16.1 Company Admin login
# @name companyAdminLogin
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{ "email": "{{companyAdminEmail}}", "password": "{{companyAdminPassword}}" }

?? status == 200

@companyAdminToken = {{companyAdminLogin.data.token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### Authentication
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### 16.2 Unauthenticated issue -> 401
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-instances/{{missingJob}}/invoice
Content-Type: application/json

{}

?? status == 401

### 16.3 Unauthenticated ledger -> 401
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/invoices

?? status == 401

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### Validation (runs ahead of lookup, so a missing job still reports the bad field)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### 16.4 A buyer VAT number that is not 15 digits -> 400
### Optional, but a malformed one is a document ZATCA rejects — so it is refused here instead.
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-instances/{{missingJob}}/invoice
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{ "buyerVatNumber": "12345" }

?? status == 400

### 16.5 A one-word void reason -> 400
### The reason stays on the permanent record; "cancelled" is not an explanation.
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-instances/{{missingJob}}/invoice/void
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{ "reason": "no" }

?? status == 400

### 16.6 A VAT summary whose end is before its start -> 400
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/invoices/vat-summary?fromUtc=2026-10-01T00:00:00Z&toUtc=2026-07-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Accept-Language: en

?? status == 400

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### Not found
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### 16.7 Invoicing a job that does not exist -> 404
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-instances/{{missingJob}}/invoice
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{}

?? status == 404

### 16.8 Reading the invoice of a job that does not exist -> 404
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-instances/{{missingJob}}/invoice
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Accept-Language: en

?? status == 404

### 16.9 Voiding an invoice that does not exist -> 404
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-instances/{{missingJob}}/invoice/void
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{ "reason": "Raised against the wrong purchase order." }

?? status == 404

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### The ledger, the chain and the VAT position
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### 16.10 The company's invoice ledger -> 200
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Accept-Language: en

?? status == 200

### 16.11 Chain verification -> 200, and the chain holds
### Re-derives every invoice's hash from its stored fields and checks each link. A tampered
### invoice fails its own hash; a removed one breaks its successor's link.
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/invoices/chain-verification
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Accept-Language: en

?? status == 200
?? body data.isIntact == true

### 16.12 VAT summary for Q3 2026 -> 200
### Output VAT from issued invoices, less voids made in the period; input VAT split into
### reclaimable, non-reclaimable, and unsupported (deductible but no vendor VAT number on file).
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/invoices/vat-summary?fromUtc=2026-07-01T00:00:00Z&toUtc=2026-10-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Accept-Language: en

?? status == 200

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### Company profile — where the seller VAT registration comes from
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### 16.13 A seller VAT registration that is not 15 digits -> 400
### Distinct from the 10-digit CR and 700 numbers, and not interchangeable with either.
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/company-profile
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "companyNameAr": "شركة السلامة لحماية الحرائق",
  "companyNameEn": "Al-Salamah Fire Protection Co.",
  "commercialRegistrationNumber": "7003385404",
  "nationalUnifiedNumber700": "7001234567",
  "vatRegistrationNumber": "12345"
}

?? status == 400
